# A stub of Sailfish.Silica, for linting Vuo's QML on a machine without the
# SailfishOS SDK.
#
# §8.1: "Sailfish.Silica only ships with the SDK, so linting QML on a CI runner
# needs a stub module." These declare the surface Vuo actually uses -- not all
# of Silica -- so that `make qmllint` resolves imports and catches real
# mistakes rather than drowning in unresolved-type noise.
#
# These stubs are NOT shipped in the RPM and are never loaded on a device. If a
# property Vuo uses is missing here, add it; do not work around it in the app.
module Sailfish.Silica

singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
Orientation 1.0 Orientation.qml
TruncationMode 1.0 TruncationMode.qml
BusyIndicatorSize 1.0 BusyIndicatorSize.qml
PageStatus 1.0 PageStatus.qml

